@modernactivism @NewBlackMan @Quinnae_Moon HUNH?

#MeToo is not an organized movement. No one is in charge. It's a freaking HASHTAG for chrissakes. People who had dealt w/sexual assault/abuse/harassment/rape, etc. wrote their own stories using the hashtag.

That's IT. You're barking up a hashtag. Jeez.

@Civilmom @sglockenspeil @NYCNavid @NeverAgainMSD @AMarch4OurLives @davidhogg111 @cameron_kasky @Emma4Change @kali4change And I'll bet that they DIDN'T have it when they started.

Our youth are whizzes at harnessing the power of the Twitterverse to organize. #blm started with a fucking HASHTAG. W/in a few days became a movement, organized rallies, &amp;only NOW has inst. support. 

Wake up to 21st C.
